# config/ is deliberately NOT excluded: R/wc_path.R reads config/cliff_paths.yml
# at load time, so excluding it breaks installation (lazy-load failure). It is
# 60K of runtime configuration. Conventionally it would live in inst/config,
# but every here("config", ...) call across the repo points at the root copy.

